  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Fund: Support in Delivery of Kenya Innovation Week - Commonwealth Edition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK, through the East Africa Research and Innovation Hub (EARIH) of the Foreign Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO), is planning to actively participate at the KIW 2023 through various activities in alignment with the KIW 2023 agenda and objectives of enabling UK-Africa STI partnerships. The project aims to forge new inter regional partnerships to expand the innovation ecosystem, showcase the best of start-ups and innovations to a range of investors; advance of emerging technologies that generate innovative solutions to environmental challenges; facilitate creation of new markets for start-ups; and launch a range of products and programmes to unlock our commonwealth.</narrative>
  </description>
